186045585 true] [17592186396612 1068 #edb/ref 17592186396613 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396612 1069 "q-106933" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396612 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396612 1071 "Let $I$ be the set of all functions $f:R\\to R$ of the form $f(x)={2}^{ax},$ where $a\\in R.$ Complete the following sentence:\n\n*$I$ is **not** a vector space (with respect to function addition and scalar multiplication of a function by a real number) because $\\text{_________}\\,.$*" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396612 1072 #uuid "17d56701-363e-5629-ba43-f0ff54124002" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396612 1074 "The correct answer is as follows:\n\n*$I$ is **not** a vector space (with respect to function addition and scalar multiplication of a function by a real number) because **$I$ does not contain the zero element.** *\n\nIndeed, $f(x)={2}^{ax}>0$ for all $x\\in R$ for any $a\\in R,$ hence the zero function $z(x)=0\\notin I.$\n\nOn the other hand:\n\n- Addition of real valued functions  is associative. $\\,✓$\n\n- $1\\cdot f=f$ for all $f\\in I.$ $\\,✓$\n\n- Addition and scalar multiplication of polynomials satisfy the distributive laws.\n$\\,✓$\n\n- Addition of real valued functions  is commutative. $\\,✓$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396613 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396614 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396613 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396615 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396613 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396616 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396613 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396617 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396613 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396618 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396613 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396613 1077 "selection" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396613 1079 #edb/ref 17592186396618 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396613 1080 #uuid "c7ef701a-1be0-572c-baca-f76e42023271" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396614 1081 "addition of functions is not commutative" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396614 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396614 1084 #uuid "62b7fc67-e9bb-5a0f-8e80-9dcf56649314" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396615 1081 "addition of functions is not associative" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396615 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396615 1084 #uuid "7cd140b2-7871-5579-9e98-6ecf9f3f51ab" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396616 1081 "addition and scalar multiplication of functions do not satisfy the distributive laws" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396616 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396616 1084 #uuid "1e058a54-9658-5798-ba7c-a86d9840498e" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396617 1081 "$1\\cdot f\\ne f$ for some $f\\in I$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396617 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396617 1084 #uuid "d6932b0d-e307-5cc8-971a-38fac820cb2a" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396618 1081 "$I$ does not contain the zero element" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396618 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396618 1084 #uuid "4d629cc1-8c34-5761-b952-696843bcc069" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396619 1068 #edb/ref 17592186396620 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396619 1069 "q-109247" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396619 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396619 1071 "Which of the following matrices are block lower triangular?\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 2\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 9\\end{aligned}],\\,C=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396619 1072 #uuid "c07f2a41-0b84-51be-b671-ed8827d6cdfb" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396619 1074 "A block lower triangular matrix can be partitioned so that it has only square blocks on the main diagonal, and the blocks above the main diagonal contain only zeros.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our matrices.\n\n- $A$ is a block lower triangular matrix. Indeed, we can partition it as follows:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- $B$ is a block lower triangular matrix. Indeed, we can partition it as follows:\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 9\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- $C$ is a block lower triangular matrix. Indeed, we can partition it as follows:\n\n$$\nC=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"$A,$ $B,$ and $C.$\"" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396620 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396621 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396620 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396622 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396620 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396623 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396620 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396624 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396620 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396625 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396620 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396620 1077 "selection" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396620 1079 #edb/ref 17592186396625 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396620 1080 #uuid "b4cfca3f-c3d8-5194-b838-5df8371ad384" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396621 1081 "$A$ and $C$ only" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396621 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396621 1084 #uuid "c4860770-5064-5335-8f48-a983fc3e37dc" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396622 1081 "None" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396622 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396622 1084 #uuid "f1c0ad1a-1579-5a1d-9f6e-b8c9de4c4be8" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396623 1081 "$A$ and $B$ only" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396623 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396623 1084 #uuid "776b96b0-8f5c-5b47-aa83-d1f82dd2dcf5" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396624 1081 "$B$ only" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396624 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396624 1084 #uuid "36e5fa30-29c5-544a-a26b-8772f9fe51ab" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396625 1081 "$A,$ $B,$ and $C$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396625 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396625 1084 #uuid "1eab1cd1-046e-5de3-9cd8-3170cc92f482" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396626 1068 #edb/ref 17592186396627 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396626 1069 "q-113918" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396626 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396626 1071 "Find the function $f(x)$ and the value of $b,$ given that ${\\int }_{0}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{i=0}^{n-1}[{e}^{6i/n}\\cdot \\frac{6}{n}].$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396626 1072 #uuid "c2081a2b-f662-517d-bd66-e0ddf60008b7" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396626 1074 "A definite integral can be defined as the limit of a left Riemann sum as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{i=0}^{n-1}f({x}_{i})\\cdot Δx\n$$\n\nwhere $Δx=\\frac{b-a}{n}$ and ${x}_{i}=a+iΔx.$\n\nNotice that we're given that the lower limit $a=0.$ \n\nComparing the given summation with the general expression above, we see that $Δx=\\frac{6}{n}.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\frac{6}{n}=\\frac{b-0}{n}\\,⟹\\,b=6.\n$$\n\nConsequently,  ${x}_{i}=\\frac{6i}{n}$ and $f({x}_{i})={e}^{{x}_{i}}.$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{6}{e}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{i=0}^{n-1}[{e}^{6i/n}\\cdot \\frac{6}{n}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $f(x)={e}^{x}$ and $b=6.$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396627 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396628 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396627 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396629 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396627 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396630 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396627 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396631 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396627 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396632 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396627 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396627 1077 "selection" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396627 1079 #edb/ref 17592186396629 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396627 1080 #uuid "224da74b-2945-552e-a5c2-10b9f76d854e" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396628 1081 "$f(x)={e}^{6x}$ and $b=6$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396628 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396628 1084 #uuid "34cc89b8-44ed-5197-913c-4b08fc997159" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396629 1081 "$f(x)={e}^{x}$ and $b=6$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396629 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396629 1084 #uuid "e2308dd8-f04b-55a3-a357-4d4562b92a56" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396630 1081 "$f(x)={e}^{6x}$ and $b=1$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396630 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396630 1084 #uuid "d9ab5d51-4c5d-5e5c-bd82-b3125ac54774" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396631 1081 "$f(x)={e}^{2x}$ and $b=3$" 13194139