592186396720 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396720 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396720 1084 #uuid "d3f965ef-6b47-527f-a571-556003d4b579" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396721 1068 #edb/ref 17592186396722 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396721 1069 "q-78302" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396721 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396721 1071 "Which of the following represents a reflection in the line $y=-x?$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396721 1072 #uuid "a51c70cd-319b-5de1-a71f-816af37c3370" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396721 1074 "The correct answer is $T=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}].$ Indeed, consider the standard basis ${i,j}$ of the Euclidean plane ${R}^{2}$ and the unit square spanned by the vectors, as shown below. \n\n![](images/9e/9e322e6ed1ddb8f1d094633e931cd179b7eb9d6f47acd7c7d0809f113df91b22.png)\n\nNow, we can find the images of ${i,j}$ under $T$, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{i}^{′} & =T(i)=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]=-j \\\\ {j}^{′} & =T(j)=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]=-i\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain the following image:\n\n![](images/4a/4a83673a409fd2e5d33b0b5f743f57af08cfb27c38e312a636179102c2172b04.png)" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396722 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396723 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396722 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396724 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396722 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396725 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396722 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396726 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396722 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396727 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396722 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396722 1077 "selection" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396722 1079 #edb/ref 17592186396726 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396722 1080 #uuid "47512c4c-4d28-5025-9b41-fddc19cb1574" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396723 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396723 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396723 1084 #uuid "272ad4ce-b146-5a57-8c5a-5d1e1b3e79ba" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396724 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396724 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396724 1084 #uuid "b7fe5771-8880-5a10-a850-ea4baad6b72e" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396725 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396725 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396725 1084 #uuid "c2191dbe-147e-5390-a126-2d6a0061ee2a" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396726 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396726 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396726 1084 #uuid "c22c0f50-7b0a-5358-91f1-6489ddb8ffdd" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396727 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396727 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396727 1084 #uuid "ace98a54-10d8-5584-91a9-8dc23cfa3eb3" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396728 1068 #edb/ref 17592186396729 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396728 1069 "q-94798" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396728 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396728 1071 "Let $S$ be the set of all polynomials in the real  variable $x$ with coefficients in $Q.$ Complete the following sentence: \n\n*$S$ is **not** a vector space (with respect to polynomials addition and multiplication of a polynomial by a real number) because $\\text{_________}\\,.$*" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396728 1072 #uuid "f0cbcdef-8d32-524c-bf12-b31a8feacf80" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396728 1074 "The correct answer is as follows:\n\n*$S$ is **not** a vector space (with respect to polynomials addition and multiplication of a polynomial by a real number) because **multiplication of functions in  $S$ by real scalars is not closed.** *\n\nIndeed, let's consider, for example, the polynomial  $f(x)=x.$ Then $f\\in S$, but $\\sqrt{2}f(x)=\\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{ }x\\notin S$ because $\\sqrt{2}\\notin Q.$\nOn the other hand: \n\n- Addition of polynomials is associative. $\\,✓$\n\n- Addition of polynomials is commutative. $\\,✓$\n\n- The zero function belongs to $S.$ $\\,✓$\n\n- $1\\cdot f=f$ for all $f\\in S.$ $\\,✓$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396729 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396730 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396729 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396731 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396729 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396732 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396729 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396733 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396729 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396734 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396729 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396729 1077 "selection" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396729 1079 #edb/ref 17592186396733 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396729 1080 #uuid "689b4114-c1d3-5f0f-8182-74e6a0c999f0" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396730 1081 "addition of polynomials is not associative" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396730 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396730 1084 #uuid "dced25c9-e7ab-5f35-8521-98dbb4380860" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396731 1081 "addition of polynomials is not commutative" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396731 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396731 1084 #uuid "44e5f623-8068-52a9-b610-cc58b0a625bb" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396732 1081 "$1\\cdot f\\ne f$ for some $f\\in S$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396732 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396732 1084 #uuid "93ab4050-ad19-5d1c-8155-556dd79d719e" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396733 1081 "multiplication of functions in  $S$ by real scalars is not closed" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396733 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396733 1084 #uuid "4542450e-69bf-52e8-919b-58face6ea7bb" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396734 1081 "$S$ does not contain the zero function" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396734 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396734 1084 #uuid "9ba8a7fb-33bd-5b6d-a7ee-19ce6a4656ed" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-103178" 17592186396577 "q-103178/ma-source-field/0fb16e5afc24444af2795ba87a624129b21cdb5ac00132dbcf5c1e8ec6a6a13a" 17592186396578 "q-103178/ma-source-field/0fb16e5afc24444af2795ba87a624129b21cdb5ac00132dbcf5c1e8ec6a6a13a/343e05bc561f1754cb89989f943a6f3c9344f2abea94d650b67c7b53d017c0c6" 17592186396579 "q-103178/ma-source-field/0fb16e5afc24444af2795ba87a624129b21cdb5ac00132dbcf5c1e8ec6a6a13a/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" 17592186396580 "q-103178/ma-source-field/0fb16e5afc24444af2795ba87a624129b21cdb5ac00132dbcf5c1e8ec6a6a13a/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff